        is_in_effects_loop: false,
        settings: { Presence: 5, Bass: 5, Middle: 6, Treble: 6, "Volume I": 7, "Volume II": 5 },
        notes:
          "Blackmore used a 100W Marshall on the Machine Head sessions — the iconic 200W Marshall Major came later, on tour. The head ran at Volume I=7, deep enough into EL34 breakup for the riff to feel meaty but clean enough that the parallel fourths stay articulate.",
